<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Health Management raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Health Management raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has raised its rating on Health Management Associates Inc to buy from attractive, citing the stock's price, the brokerage firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately released. Analyst Helen O'Donnell was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Naples, Fla.-based hospital operator were up 1/2 at 25-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
